  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.26 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Medical Imaging and Radiation Thera",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.26 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Medical Imaging and Radiation Therapy. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.26, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the executive director with the advisory board of medical imaging and radiation therapy under RSA 328-J:\n\nTable 1002.26 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Medical Imaging and Radiation Therapy\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nAny regulated MIRT profession, application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $170\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
